# Svelte Conventions

- Svelte 5 runes: `$props()`, `$state()`, `$derived()`, `$derived.by()`, `$effect()`
- Snippets: `{@render children()}` — no legacy `export let` or `$$props`
- Import shared components from `$lib/components/...`
- Import page components with `./components/...`
- Icons from `@lucide/svelte`
- Tailwind utility classes only; palette is `ecsess-*` (see `src/app.css`)
- Wrap portable text with `$lib/components/RichText.svelte`
- Use `$lib/components/layout/Section.svelte` for page sections
- Use the Svelte MCP server (`plugin-svelte-svelte`) when creating or editing components
